  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that the domain of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Let us find the domain of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>We know that domain of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Domain of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Let us find the domain of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let us find the domain of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Now the common domain is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>But given that the domain of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>36</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>36</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>36</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>36</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, the required answer is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>",
